  "details": "VRChat Version: \n w_2022.1.2p1-1004ba5928\nDescription of the bug: Infinitely expanding log files which are not automatically cleared.\nThe VRChat log files seem to continuously grow in size. It's to the point where one particular log file is actually the largest file on my entire system at ~47GB, and I am running out of space on my boot drive because of it.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): I'm unable to read the log file due to how large it is, so I am unsure. My game has a tendency to crash when the computer thermal throttles, so I assume the file size is related to the number of crashes.\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots): The log file: http://Fab5Storage.quickconnect.to/d/s/oQvkSrqIAHVVYoLaYM9zJMY5ME4t1UxH/Lm3C156_iNRTEDO_EGXI9EaiwKdSIWgk-jrvA_6GdeQk\nSmaller log files: http://Fab5Storage.quickconnect.to/d/s/oQM3citm6llGbt1iqgVO6q9bIEPPPueW/n5SXbk-mEs6DNhyLqIL5WNM-8UXYdKao-07pAV1cdeQk",
